</section><section class="bde-section-18-100 bde-section">
  
  
	



<div class="section-container"><h1 class="bde-heading-18-101 bde-heading">
Australian Wholesale Electricity & Environmental Brokers
</h1></div>
</section><section class="bde-section-18-102 bde-section">
  
  
	



<div class="section-container"><div class="bde-div-18-106 bde-div">
  
  
	



<h2 class="bde-heading-18-103 bde-heading">
Welcome to HVB
</h2>
</div><div class="bde-rich-text-18-105 bde-rich-text breakdance-rich-text-styles">
<p><strong><span style="font-size: large;">Innovative Solutions to Electricity &amp; Environmental Market Trading</span></strong></p>
<p>HVB is a leading Energy Broker in the Australian wholesale electricity and renewable energy market.</p>
<p>With over three decades of industry experience, we are an agile, professional team of energy brokers working with all Australian energy market participants, big or small. We provide individualised service and competitive rates, industry know how and tailored solutions to trading the Australian energy market.<br /><br />HVB can assist with anything market related.</p>
</div></div>
</section><section class="bde-section-18-111 bde-section">
  
  
	



<div class="section-container"></div>
</section><section class="bde-section-18-107 bde-section">
  
  
	



<div class="section-container"><h2 class="bde-heading-18-109 bde-heading">
Our Areas of Expertise​
</h2><div class="bde-rich-text-18-110 bde-rich-text breakdance-rich-text-styles">
<p>HVB is a ​Renewable Energy Certificate Broker offering a wide range of energy solutions for your business to reduce costs while increasing efficiency, reliability and sustainability.</p>
</div></div>
</section><section class="bde-section-18-112 bde-section">
  
  
	



<div class="section-container"></div>
</section><section class="bde-section-18-113 bde-section">
  
  
	



<div class="section-container"><div class="bde-columns-18-114 bde-columns"><div class="bde-column-18-115 bde-column">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-rich-text-18-117 bde-rich-text breakdance-rich-text-styles">
<div class="paragraph"><strong><span style="font-size: large;">Experience</span></strong><br />HVB offer more than 30 years of industry knowledge and experience in the Australian Energy Market.</div>
<div> </div>
<div class="paragraph"><strong><span style="font-size: large;">Customer-Focused Approach</span></strong><br />HVB work to accommodate all of our clients' needs during trading strategy and price negotiation.</div>
</div>
</div><div class="bde-column-18-116 bde-column">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-rich-text-18-118 bde-rich-text breakdance-rich-text-styles">
<div class="paragraph"><strong><span style="font-size: large;">Market Experience</span></strong><br />Our experience draws on expertise and a large customer base to achieve the desired outcome.</div>
<div> </div>
<div class="paragraph"><strong><span style="font-size: large;">Smart and Simple Solutions</span></strong><br />No fuss, straight forward and professional approach</div>
</div>
</div></div></div>
</section><section class="bde-section-43-100 bde-section">
  
  
	



<div class="section-container"><div class="bde-columns-43-101 bde-columns"><div class="bde-column-43-102 bde-column">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-rich-text-43-104 bde-rich-text breakdance-rich-text-styles">
